  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kūnīlīīla SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho balī Mispa baalī bilahīla būhaya gīkī, “Atīho nūūlū ūmò wise ūyo nshīke wakwe akūtoolwa kū banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū būja Beeseli, būūkigaasha kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu kūshisha mhīndī, bakūlīlaga ng'hūngū kūlwa būpīna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūlīla balīhaya, “Ee SEEBA, Mulungu wa Baisilaeli, nibūlī gwabilongelaga mhayo gūlī gīkī a Baisilaeli? Nibūlī ī lelo lūjimīīle lūganda lūgima kūfuma ū mu Baisilaeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho a banhū būmisha dilū būbeeja ng'walīlo, būfunya shakwinha sha kūpemva na shakwinha sha būsangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli bandya kwilula balīhaya, “Ū mu ng'anda ja Baisilaeli ī jose nani atīīho a ha libilinga lyenīlī ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA?” Nguno baalī bilahīla gīkī, ose ose ū wa kūleka kwiza kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ī Mispa, shing'wigeleelile abūlagwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo a Baisilaeli baalī baapīnīhala no kūlwa nguno ya badūgū babo, a ba lūganda lwa Benjamini. Būhaya gīkī, “Ī lelo yenīyī lūmò lwa ng'anda ja Baisilaeli lwajimīīlaga gete! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū tūkūpandīkīla halī bakīma ba kūbinha abo baashiigīīlaga ū mu lūganda lwenūlo? Nguno twaamalile kwilahīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA gīkī tūtīko kūbatooja a bashīke bise ū kūbo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini kwinhwa bakīma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bibūūja balīhaya, “Lūganda kī ū mu Baisilaeli ūlo lūtīīho ī Mispa a ha libilinga lyenīlī ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA?” Būbona gīkī ū kūfuma ī Yaabeshi-gileadi atizile munhū nūūlū ūmò ū kū ng'hambī ū kū libilinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho baababala a banhū, būbona wal'atīho hoi nūūlū ūmò wa bana Yaabeshi-gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū kwibilinga kwa Baisilaeli kūūtūma ī Yaabeshi-gileadi balwi būlūgū shihūmbī ikūmi na shibīlī; būbakomeleja kūjūbabūlaga a bikaji ba kwenūko, pye na a bakīma na a baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbawīla gīkī, “Ūyo mulagwīīte gūūyū: Būlī ngosha mukūmūlaga, na būlī nkīma ūyo walaala na ngosha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu banhū abo bikalaga Yaabeshi-gileadi, būpandīka mo baanhya magana anè, abo baalī bataalī kūlaala na ngosha ose ose; būbasola būja nabo Kanaani kū ng'hambī Shilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū kwibilinga kūūtūma nhūng'wa ū kū banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini abo baalī kwiwe lya Limoni. Būbawīla gīkī yashilaga ī ya wilemeelwa, yabizaaga ho mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho a banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini hū būshoka, biza binhwa a bakīma abo bakalekeelwa kūfuma Yaabeshi-gileadi. Gwike batapandīkile pye a bose, nguno baalī bagehū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū baalī bapīnīhala no kūlwa nguno ya banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini, īkī ū SEEBA akatūūl'ihongo ū mu ng'anda ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banamhala ba kwibilinga būhaya, “Ī gīsī lūūlū īkī twabamalile pye a bakīma ba mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, tūkūpandīkīla halī a bakīma tūbinhe a bagosha abo baasaagīīlaga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini shibigeleelilwe bapandīke shibyalīlwe, lūtizūjimīīla lūganda ū mu Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a bise Baisilaeli tūtīko ū kūbinha a bashīke bise ū kūbiza bake babo, nguno twamalile kwilahīla gīkī, ‘Azumilwe ose ose ūyo nshīke okwe alantooje kūlī munhū wa lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilembeeshagi, ī Shilo shilīko shigukulu sha ng'wa SEEBA, īsho shikabizaga ho būlī ng'waka. Shikūbiza sukuma ya Beeseli, ha kīya y'ikūūwa īlo līfumile Beeseli kūja Shekemu, dakama ya Lebona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbalangīīla a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini balībawīla gīkī, “Mulaaje mukibise mu migūnda ya mizabibu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mūyūlola; a baanikī ba bana Shilo ūlū būja nabo ū kūbina ī mbina, ī likanza lyenīlo pulukagi ū mu migūnda ya mizabibu, būlī ūmò wing'we adiime ng'wanikī; mupandīke bakīma kūfuma ū kū bana Shilo muje kū sī ying'we ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basaabo nūūlū a basīza babo ūlū biza kūtūwīla, tūkūhooya nabo tūbawīle gīkī, ‘Tūchīlagi shigongo tūbagunaane, nguno tūkilewa ū kūbapandīkīla a bakīma ū ng'wikanza lya būlūgū. A bing'we mutī na būbi nguno mutī bing'we abo mulībinha a bashīke bing'we ū kūbo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a bagosha ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini bīīta chene; a baanikī aho balībina mbina, būlī munhū ūdima nke wakwe ūbūūcha ūja; hūna būshoka kū sī ya wingīji wabo, būkīīzenga ī mizengo yabo bikala mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nabo a Baisilaeli bīnga a henaho, būshoka kū sī ja ng'anda na ndūgū jabo; būlī munhū ūja kū sī ya wingīji wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo a Baisilaeli baalī batī na ntemi, būlī ng'wene wītaga gīt'ūmo walī atogelilwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
